@node Chat buffer faces
@section Chat buffer faces

@vindex sgn-header-face
@vindex sgn-timestamp-face
@vindex sgn-deleted-face
@vindex sgn-error-face
@vindex sgn-receipt-face
@vindex sgn-quote-face
The face @code{sgn-header-face} (inheriting @code{bold}) is used for the header line that starts each group of messages@comma{} showing the sender and timestamp.  The face @code{sgn-timestamp-face} (inheriting @code{shadow}) is used for minor annotations such as @samp{(edited)} and the @samp{(sending…)} label.  The face @code{sgn-deleted-face} (inheriting @code{shadow}) is used for the @samp{[Message deleted]} placeholder.  The face @code{sgn-error-face} (inheriting @code{error}) is used for the labels of messages that were not sent@comma{} not delivered to every recipient@comma{} or not confirmed.  The face @code{sgn-receipt-face} (inheriting @code{shadow}) is used for the @samp{✓} and @samp{✓✓} delivery and read marks.  The face @code{sgn-quote-face} (inheriting @code{font-lock-comment-face}) is used for quoted message text above replies. @*

@node Text formatting faces
@section Text formatting faces

@vindex sgn-spoiler-face
@vindex sgn-spoiler-revealed-face
@vindex sgn-strikethrough-face
@vindex sgn-monospace-face
@vindex sgn-mention-face
@vindex sgn-mention-self-face
The face @code{sgn-spoiler-face} conceals spoiler text by giving it matching foreground and background colors; once revealed@comma{} the text uses @code{sgn-spoiler-revealed-face} (inheriting @code{highlight}).  The faces @code{sgn-strikethrough-face} and @code{sgn-monospace-face} (inheriting @code{fixed-pitch}) render the corresponding Signal styles; bold and italic use the standard @code{bold} and @code{italic} faces.  The face @code{sgn-mention-face} is used for @samp{@@Name} mentions of other people@comma{} and @code{sgn-mention-self-face} (inheriting @code{match}) for mentions of you. @*

@node Indicator and dashboard faces
@section Indicator and dashboard faces

@vindex sgn-unread-face
@vindex sgn-offline-face
@vindex sgn-dashboard-name-face
@vindex sgn-dashboard-name-unread-face
@vindex sgn-dashboard-preview-face
@vindex sgn-dashboard-time-face
@vindex sgn-dashboard-unread-face
@vindex sgn-dashboard-muted-face
@vindex sgn-dashboard-failure-face
The face @code{sgn-unread-face} (inheriting @code{warning}) is used for the global @samp{sgn:N} unread indicator@comma{} and @code{sgn-offline-face} (inheriting @code{error}) for the @samp{sgn:offline} indicator shown when @samp{signal-cli} has failed. @*

In the dashboard@comma{} @code{sgn-dashboard-name-face} is used for chat names and @code{sgn-dashboard-name-unread-face} (bold) for the names of chats with unread messages.  @code{sgn-dashboard-preview-face} is used for the last-message preview@comma{} @code{sgn-dashboard-time-face} for the time column@comma{} @code{sgn-dashboard-unread-face} for the unread count@comma{} @code{sgn-dashboard-muted-face} for the muted marker@comma{} and @code{sgn-dashboard-failure-face} for the banner shown above the chat list when @samp{signal-cli} has failed. @*

